; countdown.tasm — the control case.
;
; "Is the counter still positive?" is a genuinely BINARY decision. There is no
; third outcome to route, so the three-way branch has nothing to offer: the
; two-way version of this program is this program. Both variants of the benchmark
; run the same file, and the measured difference is exactly zero.
        IN
        STORE n
lp:     LOAD  n
        OUT
        ADDI  -1
        STORE n
        BR3   t
t:      .table done, done, lp
done:   HALT
        .org  -4
n:      .word 0
